  "memory": "Memory-backed synchronous code; caller + normalized + solid + compressed + final archive copies can coexist, decoded folder plus copied substreams on read, additional header/native/transient/GC allocations; no fixed peak-RSS guarantee. Exact copy accounting in SEVENZIP-COMPATIBILITY.md.",
  "method_limits": "Only one simple coder per folder; Copy/DEFLATE and LZMA2 uncompressed chunks. No compressed LZMA/LZMA2, complex filter/bindings, external metadata/encryption/SFX/volumes/updates/streaming/threading/full metadata or GUI/platform/performance parity.",
  "defaults_research": "Five pinned source options studied; no primitive adopted. Prefer reproducible public-domain SDK raw encoder/decoder build plus bounded consumed-input/output/dictionary/state adapter. Details, commits, source licenses and acceptance plan in SEVENZIP-COMPATIBILITY.md and source references."
}
